cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Contextual Resume Compression with RAG - re-implementation
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dubey
    given-names: Ankit
repository-code: https://github.com/<your-username>/resume-rag-extractor
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A re-implementation, with an extended evaluation, of "Contextual Compression
  of Unstructured Resumes using VectorStore RAG" (IEEE ICCRDA 2025). Adds a
  rule-based baseline, field-level precision/recall/F1, a random-pairing floor
  for cosine similarity, a five-way retrieval and compression ablation with
  token and cost accounting, and a categorised error analysis.
references:
  - type: conference-paper
    title: >-
      Contextual Compression of Unstructured Resumes using VectorStore RAG
    doi: 10.1109/icdsis65355.2025.11070875
    year: 2025
